      build: "Pick one anchor in your day, like your morning coffee or getting into bed, and pray there daily for two weeks. Keep a short list of the people you pray for.",
      hard: "If words won't come, one word is a prayer, and so is silence. If you're not sure who you're talking to anymore, say so. \"Here is what's true today\" is a real prayer.",
